            '<p>Specifies whether to enable mapping of Amazon Web Services Identity and Access Management (IAM) accounts to database accounts. By default, mapping isn\'t enabled.</p> <p>For more information, see <a href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/AuroraUserGuide/UsingWithRDS.IAMDBAuth.html"> IAM Database Authentication</a> in the <i>Amazon Aurora User Guide</i>.</p> <p>Valid for Cluster Type: Aurora DB clusters only</p>',
